(26393,0,0,'You look like you\'re in a hurry.  Well, then you came to the right place!',15595),
(26394,0,0,'You\'ve been traveling, eh?  Have you been anywhere interesting?',15595),
(26395,0,0,'Is that sweat on your brow, $glad:ma\'am;?  You\'ve been running too much.  Next time, take a gryphon!',15595),
(26396,0,0,'You\'re back from Stormwind?  Did Osric send the armor?',15595),
